{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"Both required validation commands finished with sandbox failures: their child checks could not create Go work directories or write caches. The focused tests, race tests, and vet checks passed.\n\nI also found that metadata decoding errors are discarded. Go can retain `selfContained: true` while failing to decode an invalid `dependsOn` value, so malformed configuration can narrow the run instead of producing an error or full-run fallback.\n"}}
